WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.020
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.860
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.860 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.740 --> 00:31.290
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.020
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.530 --> 00:58.300
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.300 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.010
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.010 --> 01:08.860
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.860 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.530 --> 01:25.180
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.850 --> 01:43.210
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.539 --> 01:46.770
=Episode 22=

01:50.560 --> 01:51.570
Xian Qing,

01:53.039 --> 01:56.000
Xian Qing, come here.

01:56.720 --> 01:57.740
Be careful.

01:58.960 --> 02:01.160
Xian Qing, you rest here.

02:01.680 --> 02:02.960
I'll go look for some herbs.

02:03.960 --> 02:04.980
Zhaoyan.

02:09.960 --> 02:14.640
You're my medicine.

02:17.200 --> 02:18.220
I'm sorry, Xian Qing.

02:18.760 --> 02:20.320
I made you end up like this.

02:21.480 --> 02:23.560
So gravely injured. I'm sorry.

02:24.280 --> 02:27.040
It's okay.

02:31.720 --> 02:32.800
Why did it become like this?

02:38.040 --> 02:39.060
Do you hate him?

02:44.840 --> 02:46.400
He and I are the closest,

02:48.400 --> 02:50.520
yet we are the ones
who hurt each other the most.

02:57.320 --> 02:58.380
Don't worry.

03:00.560 --> 03:01.960
I will always be with you.

03:10.320 --> 03:11.800
When Maiming imprisoned me today,

03:12.600 --> 03:14.160
he said he found a way
to break the binding.

03:15.560 --> 03:16.760
A way to break the binding?

03:18.280 --> 03:19.920
Our family has been bound to Rehai

03:20.520 --> 03:22.040
and thus enduring
the heavenly punishment.

03:23.240 --> 03:24.960
Maiming and I,
because of the twin's curse,

03:25.640 --> 03:28.120
have also been enduring the same pain.

03:30.680 --> 03:35.200
But Maiming, after all, has endured
more than 200 years of torment

03:37.040 --> 03:39.640
and has never been able
to step out of the family.

03:41.720 --> 03:44.880
He must have held some resentment.

03:46.000 --> 03:47.040
I owe him.

03:49.640 --> 03:50.720
Why do you think that?

03:51.800 --> 03:53.240
I'd like to free him from the binding,

03:53.960 --> 03:57.000
but he doesn't want it.
He doesn't even want me.

03:58.720 --> 04:00.600
He had been my entire life.

04:01.320 --> 04:04.400
After I met you all,
he only has himself left.

04:07.480 --> 04:09.240
He can't escape
the prison of the family,

04:10.120 --> 04:11.800
so, he wants to trap me here too.

04:13.600 --> 04:14.640
It's what I owe him.

04:19.240 --> 04:20.300
No.

04:22.200 --> 04:25.920
It's your family. Your family owes him.

04:28.360 --> 04:32.159
You are the family head, but you...

04:36.320 --> 04:37.640
Xian Qing.

04:37.640 --> 04:41.600
You are Luo Zhaoyan.

04:43.840 --> 04:44.909
I am Luo Zhaoyan.

04:47.440 --> 04:48.480
I am Luo Zhaoyan.

04:49.120 --> 04:51.560
From now on, I'll live only for myself.

05:01.800 --> 05:04.200
(Maiming, our father has passed away.)

05:04.920 --> 05:06.480
(From now on, we only have each other.)

05:08.040 --> 05:09.080
(I will protect you.)

05:09.920 --> 05:13.520
(Let's live and die together, alright?)

05:16.280 --> 05:19.320
(Maiming, as long as you want it,)

05:21.160 --> 05:22.600
(I will be like I used to be.)

05:26.800 --> 05:29.440
(I will protect you like I used to.)

05:33.440 --> 05:34.760
I hate you.

05:38.580 --> 05:39.640
Xiu.

05:39.640 --> 05:40.880
Master.

05:40.880 --> 05:42.030
Do you like it?

05:42.030 --> 05:43.120
Yeah.

05:44.560 --> 05:45.680
Xiu.

05:45.680 --> 05:46.800
What would you like for lunch?

05:48.480 --> 05:49.490
Stir-fried greens?

05:50.000 --> 05:52.159
I don't want to eat burnt greens.

05:53.360 --> 05:56.159
The families I found for you before

05:56.159 --> 05:57.900
were well-off and also treated you well.

05:58.480 --> 05:59.890
But you refused to be adopted by them.

06:00.440 --> 06:02.920
You can only get burnt greens
to eat when living with me.

06:03.840 --> 06:06.440
I hate demons and also humans.

06:06.440 --> 06:07.560
I only want you.

06:11.040 --> 06:14.920
Silly, in the Six Realms,
there are both good and bad beings.

06:14.920 --> 06:15.950
You can't generalize it to all.

06:20.240 --> 06:22.600
I have a friend named Xian Qing

06:22.600 --> 06:25.440
who often comes to freeload
but has good cooking skills.

06:25.440 --> 06:27.320
Next time he comes,
let's have him cook for us.

06:29.560 --> 06:31.920
Play a game with me.

06:39.320 --> 06:43.000
No, the cloud pear tree
wasn't there at that time.

06:44.320 --> 06:45.360
I was still in the illusion.

06:47.120 --> 06:49.960
My oversight. You found it.

06:50.560 --> 06:53.520
Guardian of Pureness,
I underestimated you.

06:58.000 --> 07:03.200
(Dragon Pool)
So he's just a snoopy man.

07:04.000 --> 07:05.120
Commonly known as a freak.

07:06.840 --> 07:10.440
(Dragon Pool's Garrison, Guard of Guixu)
I just mirror your thoughts. Next time...

07:10.440 --> 07:11.640
You won't have another chance.

07:12.640 --> 07:15.760
Is that so? Then let's wait and see.

07:22.360 --> 07:23.440
What's wrong, Qi?

07:24.800 --> 07:27.440
Just feeling a bit odd. It's nothing.

07:36.360 --> 07:37.460
You've arrived.

07:42.000 --> 07:43.040
Another one of the garrison.

07:43.760 --> 07:44.960
I am not one of them.

07:46.000 --> 07:47.020
Then what are you?

07:47.560 --> 07:50.720
(Su He, Dragon Pool's Incarnation)
I'm Su He, the Dragon Pool.

07:51.560 --> 07:52.620
Dragon Pool?

07:53.240 --> 07:54.640
I've heard each spring has its form,

07:55.680 --> 07:57.200
but I never thought
you'd take human form.

07:59.040 --> 08:01.880
I am already aware of your intentions
from the stream of memories.

08:03.480 --> 08:06.400
Can you truly revive the departed?

08:09.840 --> 08:12.840
I cannot revive someone
without a trade-off.

08:14.280 --> 08:16.280
At the cost
of the existence of the wisher,

08:17.240 --> 08:20.560
I can bring back the person they want.

08:21.400 --> 08:25.070
The existence of the wisher?
What does that mean?

08:28.880 --> 08:31.520
The number of lives in the world
is fixed and cannot be changed.

08:37.799 --> 08:39.039
To resurrect a life,

08:39.840 --> 08:41.600
the wisher must sacrifice

08:42.240 --> 08:45.440
their own life

08:46.320 --> 08:49.400
and all the memories
associated with them.

08:54.120 --> 08:55.800
Isn't this just trading
one life for another?

08:57.600 --> 08:59.960
And after that,

08:59.960 --> 09:02.440
it's as if the wisher never existed.

09:03.600 --> 09:04.660
That is impossible.

09:06.800 --> 09:10.240
The impact of what the wisher
has done will also vanish.

09:11.040 --> 09:12.050
Wouldn't all get mixed up?

09:12.760 --> 09:15.040
The garbled parts will be corrected
by the path of heaven.

09:15.720 --> 09:19.240
The traces of the wisher
will naturally be overlaid by others.

09:21.840 --> 09:23.040
So you mean

09:23.880 --> 09:27.440
what that one did will be remembered
as done by someone else

09:27.440 --> 09:30.120
and that no one
will feel anything wrong.

09:31.040 --> 09:32.080
Exactly.

09:34.240 --> 09:37.010
Jinzhao, if one day,
something happens to me,

09:37.010 --> 09:38.610
you must not exchange yourself for me.

09:38.610 --> 09:41.250
Because I don't want
to forget you at all.

09:41.250 --> 09:42.320
Don't talk nonsense.

09:43.250 --> 09:45.890
Miss Ming, you mustn't do it.

09:46.890 --> 09:48.930
If you exchange yourself for Mr. Gu,

09:48.930 --> 09:51.010
then there will be no Ming Xiu
in this world.

09:51.010 --> 09:55.850
Ming Xiu, even the traces
that you've ever left will be gone.

10:01.970 --> 10:04.170
The best comfort for the departed

10:04.170 --> 10:05.930
is to live well.

10:07.170 --> 10:10.170
As long as the living inherit
the wishes and beliefs of the deceased,

10:10.170 --> 10:12.650
the deceased are in a sense resurrected,

10:12.650 --> 10:14.330
having their lives continued.

10:16.210 --> 10:17.300
I

10:21.970 --> 10:24.290
will live on as the continuation
of my master's life.

10:29.210 --> 10:30.330
And then one day...

10:32.970 --> 10:34.130
(We'll meet again.)

10:44.730 --> 10:48.570
Ming Xiu, you can make such a decision.

10:50.130 --> 10:51.250
You are truly remarkable.

10:51.830 --> 10:56.050
♪Can't bear to see your tears♪

10:58.580 --> 11:02.510
♪I can't be without you♪

11:03.150 --> 11:07.730
♪Take away my frail life♪

11:11.210 --> 11:14.170
Miss Ming, I am sorry.

11:14.770 --> 11:19.380
♪Like hidden feelings
as sharp as icicles♪

11:20.170 --> 11:21.200
No need to apologize.

11:24.450 --> 11:25.520
You need not apologize.

11:29.450 --> 11:31.170
Saving everyone
was my master's own decision.

11:34.250 --> 11:35.370
He never resented you,

11:37.650 --> 11:38.650
so I won't resent you either.

11:40.430 --> 11:45.390
♪Why do I see tears
shimmering in your eyes♪

11:46.030 --> 11:50.700
♪What I thought would be evergreen
withers between my fingers♪

11:51.530 --> 11:54.970
Miss Ming, thank you.

12:00.130 --> 12:01.140
Why are you crying?

12:07.170 --> 12:09.610
Thank you for not resenting me.

12:11.220 --> 12:14.900
♪Don't eavesdrop on me in the dream♪

12:17.250 --> 12:18.450
I will send you out.

12:22.190 --> 12:26.990
♪In the dream♪

12:29.330 --> 12:32.050
♪Singing my yearning♪

12:32.650 --> 12:33.680
This is Mount Yuqing.

12:35.210 --> 12:36.330
Where are Jinzhao and Little Yue?

12:37.050 --> 12:38.610
Didn't Su He send them back too?

12:44.050 --> 12:45.330
Where did you send them?

12:47.290 --> 12:48.970
I know you're here for another thing.

12:51.570 --> 12:55.890
Yes, I am.

12:58.050 --> 13:01.170
There's something I want to ask you.

13:02.170 --> 13:04.930
You said this is where
all memories of the world reside.

13:08.650 --> 13:10.490
There must be memories
of Qi and me, right?

13:11.850 --> 13:15.450
I want to know
what our past was actually like.

13:21.610 --> 13:24.010
You can go to
the Ruins of Memory on your own.

13:24.010 --> 13:27.090
But you will also bear
the pain from your past.

13:27.090 --> 13:28.450
Have you thought it through?

13:28.450 --> 13:29.490
I'm not afraid.

13:30.650 --> 13:32.850
Qi, are you ready?

13:42.260 --> 13:45.330
(Ruins of Memory)

13:52.850 --> 13:54.690
Is it to make a wish to the divine tree?

13:54.690 --> 13:56.450
Like the tree
outside the Matchmaker's temple?

13:58.530 --> 13:59.540
Let's give it a try.

14:10.530 --> 14:14.530
Divine tree, please reveal to me
all memories from three years ago.

14:16.410 --> 14:19.250
Also, please let me
retrieve my memories.

14:51.850 --> 14:52.910
Qi.

14:54.530 --> 14:55.540
Jinzhao.

14:57.050 --> 14:59.010
Jinzhao, look, it is working.

15:08.810 --> 15:11.290
These seem all your memories.

15:17.170 --> 15:18.170
Is this me?

15:20.530 --> 15:21.970
So this is what you
looked like as a child.

15:23.210 --> 15:26.410
You look quite cute, actually.

15:34.010 --> 15:35.060
Who is this person?

15:37.170 --> 15:39.290
Probably a friend of mine from before.

15:48.570 --> 15:52.290
You'd been together all this time.

15:54.530 --> 15:59.130
Yes, I really want to see
what he looks like as a grown-up.

16:03.210 --> 16:04.300
Look, that's it.

16:12.410 --> 16:15.730
Jinzhao, this person looks like you.

16:29.850 --> 16:32.530
This is me?

16:35.170 --> 16:40.530
The one who's grown up with you is me?

16:43.650 --> 16:47.370
Jinzhao, so these are just our memories.

16:57.850 --> 16:58.860
Bian Luohuan.

17:03.610 --> 17:04.690
Bian Luohuan?

17:16.890 --> 17:17.970
How could it be him?

17:19.930 --> 17:20.980
It's all him.

17:24.410 --> 17:26.369
Qi, what's wrong?

17:40.170 --> 17:41.200
Qi.

17:59.540 --> 18:05.300
♪Twin flowers bloom on the same branch♪

18:05.300 --> 18:11.340
♪Autumn comes and spring goes.
Eventually they fall♪

18:11.340 --> 18:16.080
♪The sun rises and the moon sets♪

18:16.650 --> 18:17.780
Who do you see?

18:19.890 --> 18:22.090
(Qi, who do you want to see?)

18:24.280 --> 18:25.780
♪Under the sycamore tree♪

18:26.330 --> 18:30.250
Jinzhao, it seems
all my memories have returned.

18:30.770 --> 18:34.860
♪Breaking off a branch
to exchange for the memories♪

18:37.970 --> 18:38.990
What about me?

18:41.690 --> 18:42.770
Where am I then?

18:46.450 --> 18:52.560
♪I promise you a lifetime
of joy and yearning♪

18:52.560 --> 18:58.800
♪Burying your past
in the hustle and bustle♪

18:58.800 --> 19:04.980
♪I'll accompany you
through ups and downs♪

19:04.980 --> 19:11.060
♪Don't be afraid♪

19:11.060 --> 19:16.880
♪Writing about your struggle♪

19:17.650 --> 19:23.570
♪Being irrational and silly
because of you♪

19:23.570 --> 19:29.680
♪Betting your whole life♪

19:30.350 --> 19:34.960
♪No answer, no giving up♪

19:53.360 --> 19:58.740
♪Endless mist weaves
a tapestry of falling petals♪

20:02.250 --> 20:04.410
She remembered after all.

20:05.490 --> 20:10.450
♪Let worries melt away with the blood♪

20:10.450 --> 20:15.090
♪Can you hear my mumble of love♪

20:15.730 --> 20:21.870
♪I promise you a lifetime
of joy and yearning♪

20:21.870 --> 20:27.180
♪Burying your past
in the hustle and bustle♪

20:28.090 --> 20:31.290
(What about me? Where are my memories?)

20:34.700 --> 20:39.860
♪Don't be afraid♪

20:41.010 --> 20:42.050
(Who exactly am I?)

20:46.450 --> 20:52.500
♪Being irrational and silly
because of you♪

20:52.500 --> 20:59.380
♪Betting your whole life♪

20:59.380 --> 21:05.040
♪No answer, no giving up♪

21:05.890 --> 21:08.090
Zhaoyan, Xian Qing,
are your injuries better?

21:08.090 --> 21:09.570
I've taken the medicine
left by Hanjiang.

21:09.570 --> 21:10.770
I'm much better now. Don't worry.

21:13.890 --> 21:15.810
Jinzhao, Little Yue,
you finally came back.

21:16.410 --> 21:17.420
I'm going back.

21:22.890 --> 21:24.850
Miss Yue, are you all right?

21:27.010 --> 21:29.770
Something happened. What about you?

21:31.330 --> 21:32.970
Something happened to us too.

21:33.810 --> 21:34.970
I'll tell you about it later.

21:37.410 --> 21:38.480
How is Xiu?

21:40.650 --> 21:41.780
She is waiting for us.

21:42.330 --> 21:45.330
Miss Ming gave up
on exchanging herself for Mr. Gu.

21:47.530 --> 21:49.930
Xiu would never do anything
to disappoint Hanjiang.

21:51.770 --> 21:54.410
Let's go and see Hanjiang off together.

22:23.970 --> 22:27.290
(Master, all of a sudden,)

22:28.570 --> 22:30.650
(I realize I'm not alone.)

22:33.050 --> 22:34.690
(These guys who have been with me)

22:36.290 --> 22:38.290
(must be the friends
you told me about before.)

22:40.370 --> 22:43.730
(But I was slow to understand it.)

22:43.730 --> 22:45.330
(Gu Hanjiang's Tomb)

22:45.330 --> 22:46.810
(You won't blame me, will you?)

22:56.570 --> 22:57.620
(Master,)

22:59.410 --> 23:02.210
(I'll live my life to the fullest,
just like you would've wanted,)

23:04.410 --> 23:05.610
(and guard Pureness forever.)

23:11.250 --> 23:14.610
(Gu Hanjiang's Tomb)
(Mr. Gu, I will not let you down.)

23:15.370 --> 23:17.090
(I'll forge a path of my own.)

23:20.170 --> 23:25.570
Xiu, let Hanjiang rest in peace.

23:35.890 --> 23:39.090
Master, may you rest in peace.

23:44.810 --> 23:47.970
(Mr. Gu, farewell.)

24:09.970 --> 24:11.020
Jinzhao.

24:19.410 --> 24:21.330
If you don't respond, I'm coming in.

24:50.890 --> 24:52.490
I heard you didn't find your memories

24:53.130 --> 24:54.410
in the Ruins of Memory.

24:56.170 --> 24:57.170
You can't accept that?

25:01.330 --> 25:02.350
Can you?

25:05.610 --> 25:09.090
Past memories don't matter to me.

25:10.250 --> 25:12.690
What does it matter
if they exist or not?

25:13.730 --> 25:15.210
It's easier to talk.

25:21.090 --> 25:22.530
Alas, poor Hanjiang.

25:23.850 --> 25:26.850
He borrowed my demonic orb
to extend his life for half a day,

25:27.730 --> 25:29.330
and all of it was used on you.

25:31.370 --> 25:32.770
I have let Mr. Gu down.

25:34.370 --> 25:38.370
Now, I can't even

25:39.890 --> 25:41.410
call myself Yue Jinzhao rightfully.

25:43.570 --> 25:45.450
Nor can I rewrite my destiny as he said.

25:51.970 --> 25:53.690
Hanjiang spoke
of struggling against fate.

25:55.450 --> 25:58.250
Is it nonsense to you?

25:59.610 --> 26:03.010
I don't know where I came from
or why I exist at all.

26:04.930 --> 26:08.770
Mr. Gu needed to know
one's birth characters

26:08.770 --> 26:10.130
to tell the fortune.

26:12.210 --> 26:15.410
Without even my birth characters,
how can I talk about change?

26:17.090 --> 26:18.250
Let alone surpassing it.

26:22.810 --> 26:23.860
Come with me.

26:36.250 --> 26:39.730
Say what you just said
in front of him again.

26:40.310 --> 26:42.420
(Gu Hanjiang's Tomb)

26:43.410 --> 26:45.370
He once cautioned you with his life

26:46.490 --> 26:47.970
that no matter what setbacks
you encounter,

26:48.650 --> 26:50.970
you must continue
to move forward and not fall down.

27:06.610 --> 27:08.750
(Gu Hanjiang's Tomb)

27:19.770 --> 27:20.780
Mr. Gu,

27:24.050 --> 27:25.090
who exactly am I?

27:27.890 --> 27:31.210
In this world,

27:34.690 --> 27:36.490
does Yue Jinzhao really exist?

27:45.490 --> 27:48.400
(Gu Hanjiang's Tomb)

27:56.010 --> 27:57.170
Who exactly am I?

28:05.520 --> 28:06.610
(Gu Hanjiang's Tomb)

28:14.010 --> 28:18.450
What? Even you look down on me?

28:41.130 --> 28:42.730
(The future can be changed.)

28:44.490 --> 28:45.810
Even if the future is terrible,

28:46.390 --> 28:48.850
Miss Yue is by your side.
What is there to fear?

28:50.010 --> 28:51.210
Take this coin as a token.

28:51.730 --> 28:53.730
Don't forget what I said today.

28:58.450 --> 28:59.540
I understand now.

29:01.490 --> 29:02.860
(Gu Hanjiang's Tomb)
No matter the past,

29:04.650 --> 29:10.010
the future is always in my hands.

29:12.930 --> 29:13.970
Okay.

29:15.500 --> 29:19.810
Since Heaven is unjust,
I will defy it and change my fate.

29:23.960 --> 29:26.450
(Gu Hanjiang's Tomb)

30:17.970 --> 30:19.060
Blasted fate.

30:21.370 --> 30:25.410
From now on,
I will never believe in you again.

30:30.010 --> 30:35.010
I will walk my own way!

30:44.810 --> 30:48.650
Come on, you think I'd be scared of you?

30:54.370 --> 30:57.930
Come on!

31:20.090 --> 31:21.140
I'm not afraid of you.

31:24.610 --> 31:28.010
I'm not afraid of you.

32:03.600 --> 32:06.540
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

32:07.700 --> 32:10.190
♪Let go of all regrets♪

32:10.190 --> 32:15.570
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

32:17.200 --> 32:20.880
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

32:20.880 --> 32:25.490
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

32:26.480 --> 32:29.970
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

32:30.960 --> 32:33.300
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

32:33.300 --> 32:36.460
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

32:36.460 --> 32:38.480
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

32:38.480 --> 32:42.580
♪I have no regrets♪

32:42.580 --> 32:47.790
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

32:49.130 --> 32:50.170
I will no longer be lost.

32:51.210 --> 32:52.490
Nor will I hesitate anymore.

32:53.890 --> 32:57.490
I'll try hard to solve all the puzzles.

32:59.290 --> 33:02.930
I will try hard to become stronger

33:04.290 --> 33:05.730
so I can always protect you.

33:11.570 --> 33:12.650
I'll be with you.

33:18.230 --> 33:20.240
♪Miracle♪

33:21.140 --> 33:22.770
♪I will protect you in my life♪

33:22.770 --> 33:26.060
♪That's my love for you♪

33:48.810 --> 33:50.250
Uncle, why do you keep staring at me?

33:52.450 --> 33:53.850
I'm just surprised you would come here.

33:54.850 --> 33:57.010
I thought you would stay
with Hanjiang in Mount Yuqing.

33:59.970 --> 34:02.730
Miss Yue and Mr. Yue ran around
everywhere to help me before.

34:03.570 --> 34:04.650
I should accompany them here.

34:07.490 --> 34:08.570
You have really grown up.

34:09.650 --> 34:10.690
You cherish friends.

34:13.969 --> 34:15.060
This is called courtesy.

34:18.449 --> 34:19.540
Soul fish!

34:28.010 --> 34:29.170
I want to see Zhu Yu.

34:29.170 --> 34:30.250
Her Lordship is unavailable now.

34:31.050 --> 34:33.770
I am the young lord here.
You dare to stop me?

35:00.050 --> 35:01.140
Zhu Yu.

35:04.130 --> 35:05.140
Zhu Yu!

35:16.130 --> 35:17.230
Zhu Yu.

35:21.690 --> 35:22.740
Zhu Yu.

35:34.810 --> 35:35.860
Zhu Yu.

35:42.890 --> 35:45.450
Qi, you have come.

36:07.090 --> 36:09.570
Zhu Yu, you are Lord Ming.

36:49.750 --> 36:52.660
♪Looking back♪

36:53.780 --> 36:56.980
♪I try to bring back memories♪

36:57.880 --> 37:01.780
♪We're connected♪

37:01.780 --> 37:04.050
♪It's meant to be♪

37:05.650 --> 37:09.300
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

37:09.820 --> 37:13.620
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

37:13.620 --> 37:15.860
♪On a moonlight night♪

37:15.860 --> 37:17.840
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

37:17.840 --> 37:20.560
♪About you♪

37:20.560 --> 37:23.860
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

37:24.560 --> 37:27.960
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

37:28.500 --> 37:30.360
♪The past glided before my mind♪

37:30.360 --> 37:32.600
♪I smiled and cried♪

37:32.600 --> 37:37.850
♪For happiness♪

37:37.850 --> 37:41.750
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

37:41.750 --> 37:45.840
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

37:45.840 --> 37:47.800
♪In this tranquil world♪

37:47.800 --> 37:49.840
♪I've finally found you♪

37:49.840 --> 37:53.880
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

37:53.880 --> 37:57.620
♪I've been looking for you♪

37:57.620 --> 38:01.750
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

38:02.580 --> 38:04.020
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

38:04.020 --> 38:06.290
♪I engrave your name♪

38:06.290 --> 38:12.310
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

